---
alwaysApply: true
---
Always update the cache-busting query parameter on static assets served via GitHub Pages.

- When you change `style.css`, `script.js`, or `data.js`, increment the timestamp in the `?v=` query inside `app/index.html`.
- Use a UTC timestamp down to the second (e.g. `YYYYMMDDThhmmssZ`) so browsers fetch the newest files without Shift+Reload.
